# Local secrets and settings. The example is the one that is meant to be here.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# What Google hands you when you create an OAuth client. The browser flow
# never uses the client secret inside it, so the right move is to delete the
# file; this is the net in case one is downloaded again.
client_secret_*.json

# The upstream bestiary, kept so `npm run bestiary` need not refetch it.
tools/.cache/
